The '''Infernal Tower''' (異界にゃんこ塔, ''Ikai Nyanko Tō'', '''Otherworldly Cat Tower''') is an event added in the [[Version 11.0 Update]], with the extension of floors [[Infernal Tower/Floor 31|31]] - [[Infernal Tower/Floor 40|40]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8.]], and the extensions of floor [[Infernal Tower/Floor 41|41]] - [[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|50]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]]. It has the same mechanics and similar stages to the [[Heavenly Tower]], but is much more challenging, with a strong focus on [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies. To access the Infernal Tower, the player must have cleared [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] of the Heavenly Tower.
{{Map Stars|4080}}

==Overview==
The Infernal Tower contains 50 stages, called Floors (階, ''Kai''), with [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, [[:Category:Enemy Cats|Enemy Cats]], and even [[:Category:Event Enemies|event enemies]] from monthly and annual events. After completing a floor for the first time, the player will receive rewards including [[Catseye]]s, [[Catfruit]], [[Catamin Stages|Catamins]], and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. The [[True Form]]s of [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Hermit Cat]], [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]], and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] are rewarded on the [[Infernal Tower/Floor 30|30th Floor]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 40|40th Floor]], and [[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|50th floor]] via [[Catnip Challenges]]. [[Infernal Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] is also the only source of Gold Catfruit Seeds as of {{CurrentVer}}.

