==Recommendations==
*Due to the Aku Altar in Floor 30, it's recommended to clear [[The Aku Realms]] before attempting it.
*Spam to win works for most of the early stages.
*Most of the stages can't be cheesed, including Floor 30.
*Completing the entire tower grants 36 [[Catseye]]s, 51 [[Catamin Stages|Catamins]], 60 [[Ototo Corps|Materials]], 1 Gold Catfruit, 30 Cat CPUs (Equivalent to 15 Gold CPUs), 6 Dark Cateyes and 3 rare Catfruit seeds (1 Gold and 2 Elder, Aku or Epic), making it worth the effort to go through the tower every time it appears even if already completed once.

===Recommended Cats===
A list of Cats the player should have in possession to go through all 50 floors.

====[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]====
[[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] should be around level 20+50 by this point. Other useful Normal Cats include [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and maybe [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]]. [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|True Superfeline]], if you have it, can be helpful on stages like Floor 30, 40, and 50, for rushing down the bosses or peons.

====[[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]]====
Aside from [[Cat Combo]] units, [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] with [[Talents]] can excel on several floors. Additionally, Talented [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] can help in Floor 30 with his strong stats and complete [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immunity]]. Many of the [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] are obviously important, including [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] and, if there are no alternatives, [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]].

====[[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]====
Some excellent Rare Cats include [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]]'s forms and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]].

====[[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]]====
[[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] should be at least level 30; 40 is even better. Beyond that, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] are great as always, and [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] and [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] are one of the best units to bring to the Metal stages.

====[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]]====
*Unsurprisingly, [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cats in the Cradle]], [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss Reborn]], [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]] and [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] and [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] Ubers are great counters to many of these stages.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]] and [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Keiji]] also work wonders here, especially in Floor 24.
*Several of the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] are useful to have, especially [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]] and [[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Devils]]. Likewise, due to their many forms, several [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Dark Heroes]] can be used to counter multiple stages.
*With the exception of [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Zeus]] and to some extent, [[Lightmother Aset (Uber Rare Cat)|Lightmother Aset]], all the ubers from [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties]] work quite well on many of the stages.

===Boss Skip/Speedrun===
*Floor 25: As with the original, Heavy Assault C.A.T. boss fight and Berserkory spawn on a timer, so they can be skipped by using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other high speed/DPS units like Can Can Cat or Maglev Cat reach and destroy the enemy base early. More firepower, Combos or a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] would also be needed for obvious reasons.
*Floor 40: [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] supported with manic lion can chain [[Spiritual Yulala (Enemy)|Yulala]] and kill him before the peons become too disruptive and trivializing the stage.

