==Checkpoint System==
Clearing certain floors will allow the player to start Infernal Tower further than usual on subsequent appearances:
*[[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]] lets you start on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 11|Floor 11]] on the following appearance.
*[[Infernal Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] lets you start on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 21|Floor 21]] on the following appearance.
*[[Infernal Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] lets you start on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 31|Floor 31]] on the following appearance.
*[[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]] lets you start on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 41|Floor 41]] on the following appearance

