==Trivia==
*Since the [[Heavenly Tower]] references [[wikia:dragonball:Korin Tower|Korin Tower]] from ''Dragon Ball'', the Infernal Tower may be based off of [[wikia:dragonball:Chocolay Tower|Chocolay Tower]] - a darker, more sinister counterpart of Korin Tower.
*Instead of being blank like most stages with multiple possible rewards, the randomized reward descriptions will always display the default type of each drop (Bricks for materials, Special Catseyes for Catseyes, Catamin A for Catamins, and Elder Catfruit Seed for Elder/Aku/Epic Seeds). This possibly may have been done to help players in choosing which stages to replay for the items they want, so that they don't have to back out every time to check the map info for each stage's drops.

